    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：酸奶/破锅/多姐/大六</span></p><span></span><p><span>工资保密是资本家的骗局</span></p><span></span><p><span>工资等于价值是资本家的陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span>而你的价值远高于他们开出的价格才是这个世界的真相</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你什么都不做</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你只是存在着</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么你是否会觉得值得</span></p><span></span><p><span>是否会觉得自己的人生仍旧有意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是会觉得自己是个废物</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们想</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管怎样</span></p><span></span><p><span>都没关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都是让这个星球欣欣向荣的生命体</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们努力相信</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们存在着</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们充满价值</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>worth （Michelle Chamuel）</span></p><span></span><p><span>price tag</span></p><span></span><p><span>free</span></p>]]></description>
